<title>CHINA: Spain offers $600 mln credits to China.</title>
<headline>Spain offers $600 mln credits to China.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain has pledged to offer China government credits totalling $600 million between 1997 and 1998, the Xinhua news agency said in an overnight report.</p>
<p>The memorandum of understanding on bilateral financial cooperation was signed in Beijing on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
